<title>USA: PACE Health completes offering.</title>
<headline>PACE Health completes offering.</headline>
<dateline>WEST DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PACE Health Management Systems Inc said Wednesday it completed a 900,000 share offering at $3.25 per share. All shares sold were offered by the company.</p>
<p>PACE had filed a registration statement in July 1996 for a proposed public offering of 2,260,000 shares of common stock, but due to market conditions the company had reduced the number of shares it offered to 900,000.</p>
<p>The sale increases the total outstanding common stock to 5,090,188 shares and provided $2,925,000 in proceeds to the company, which develops advanced patient care management software systems.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
